[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3843.91, "timestamp": "01:04:03", "text": "我的天哪，我被她压制住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3845.91, "timestamp": "01:04:05", "text": "但是，没错，小事和大事正在发生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3849.109, "timestamp": "01:04:09", "text": "做得好，非常棒，康复工作做得很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3871.67, "timestamp": "01:04:31", "text": "但它并没有起到多大作用。"}]